        {
            "key": "onboarding.outer_garden_body",
            "value": "This is a symbolic space — walk around and see everyone you've invited to Amal, and everyone they've invited too.\n\nThis is your Sadaqah Jariyah: a good deed that keeps giving, growing quietly even when you're not looking. The Prophet ﷺ taught us that when a person dies, their deeds end — except three, and among them is knowledge that benefits others, and a legacy that keeps producing good.\n\nEvery new face here is a small reminder of the good you've helped set in motion."
        },
